sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as Ocean/Road Telematics
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka Broker
    participant Spark as PySpark Engine
    participant DB as Postgres/pgvector
    participant Agent as LangGraph Cyclical Agents
    participant UI as Streamlit UI

    Sensor->>Kafka: Emit Container Coordinates & Temp
    Kafka->>Spark: Stream Structured Ingestion
    Spark->>DB: Write Geofence Events & Anomaly Flags
    DB->>Agent: Trigger Risk Evaluator on Threshold Breach
    Agent->>Agent: Cyclic Research, Analysis, & Verification
    Agent->>UI: Render Actionable Alert & HITL Approval